      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-10-004\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20029]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'><sup>ST</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> STAGE OF LABOR:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20030]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Duration </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20031]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Primi</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gravida</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, 8 \u2013 18 hours, 2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>nd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> gravida onwards 5 \u2013 12 hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20032]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Latent 1</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><strong>st</strong></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> stage:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20033]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can be continuous or intermittent</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20034]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contraction present along with some cervical </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Change that can be in either</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> cervical</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> positio</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>n, consistency, effacement </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>or dilatation </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>up</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 4 cm.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20035]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Established 1</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><strong>st</strong></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> stage:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20036]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Regular contraction</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20037]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>       </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Progressive cervical dilatation beyond 4cm.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20038]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20039]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Initial assessment and triage, Review.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20040]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Women\u2019s obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> notes</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20041]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Risk factors</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20042]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Wishes and concerns</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20043]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Place of birth discussion</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20044]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Individualized care plan.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20045]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Examination:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20046]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Abdominal</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Vaginal</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>FHR</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20047]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- SFH</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20048]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Position</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- For 1 min</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20049]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Lie</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bishop</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- immediately </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20050]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Presentation</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>after </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>contraction</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20051]\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Palpate</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20052]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>                                                    maternal pulse</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20053]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PPI don\u2019t offer routinely</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20054]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PPI offer to those who received opioids or going to have C/S.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20055]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Drink to thirst, isotonic fluids more beneficial than water.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20056]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can take light diet unless received opioids or going to have C/S.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20057]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Don\u2019t routinely perform amniotomy </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> oxytocin</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20058]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Don\u2019t offer clinical intervention if labor is progressive.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20059]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Observations during 1</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><u><strong>st</strong></u></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> Stage:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20060]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20061]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Temp</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>B.P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>R/R</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vaginal examination</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bladder care</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fluid balance \u2013 intake/ output</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Frequency of passing urine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Inability to pass urine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Sensation</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Present</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>absent</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Check fluid balance</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If fluid balance </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>normal or on </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>oxytocin, then insert</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Catheter</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HR</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>All observations if women have complications or being transferred to other birth setting.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>\u00bd hourly</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>  </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>1 hourly</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>4 hourly</strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20062]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contraction frequency</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20063]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20064]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20065]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20066]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20067]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20068]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20069]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20070]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20071]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20072]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20073]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20074]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20075]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20076]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Delay in 1</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><strong>st</strong></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> stage of labor is suspected when:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20077]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cervical dilatation &lt; 2cm in 4 hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20078]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Descent and rotation of baby\u2019s head is delayed</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20079]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Change in strength, duration and frequency of contraction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20080]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20081]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20082]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Full assessment by knowing parity, uterine contraction, cervical dilation and rate of change, station and position of presenting part.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20083]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20084]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20085]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer support and effective pain relief</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20086]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20087]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20088]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20089]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20090]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Repeat examination after 2 hours</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20091]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suspect delay if dilation &lt; 1 cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20092]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20093]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20094]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer amniotomy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20095]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Explain procedure</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20096]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Advice that it will shorten labor by an hour.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20097]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20098]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20099]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Repeat examination after 2 hours</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20100]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20101]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20102]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Shift to obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> unit by following principles of transfer</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Detailed and full assessment by obstetrician including abdominal examination and consideration of oxytocin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Commen</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ce </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>oxytocin infusi</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>on if </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Women </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>agree</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contractions are inadequate</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Follow protocols of oxytocin administrations</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Repeat examination after 4 hours.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Progress &gt; 2cm</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>progress &lt; 2cm</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Continue care</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> review to </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>                                                                               </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>assess </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>for C/S</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Normal progress</strong></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>no progress</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em>Confirm Delay</em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20103]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20104]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Continue care and support</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20105]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20106]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20107]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20108]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20109]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20110]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20111]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20112]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20113]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20114]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20115]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20116]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20117]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20118]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20119]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20120]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20121]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20122]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20123]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20124]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20125]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Protocols of Oxytocin Administrations:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20126]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Start after discussion with women, stop whenever she wants.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20127]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>E</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ffective analgesia i.e., epidural</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20128]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In Obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> led units after obstetrician\u2019s advice</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20129]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CTG</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20130]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Monitor fluid balance</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20131]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> I/V fluid routinely except patient is not drinking or dehydrated or hypotensive</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20132]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incremental doses not less than 30 min, till 3 \u2013 4 contractions in 10 minutes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20133]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Stop oxytocin:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20134]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contractions &gt; 4 in 10 minutes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20135]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abnormal CTG</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20136]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Women\u2019s request.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20137]\">\u00a0</p>",
